"""Mutations of the meleeTracker's route around parked cars (src/game/melee_tracker_route.cpp, part 4)
and the car's footprint (C_Car::GetFootprint, car_marks.cpp) for ../mutfast.py with the route build:

    python mutfast.py mutations/mutate_route.py --models DIR --build build_route.bat --check check_route.py

Each should make check_route.py fail (or the harness crash / hang). Left out as equivalent: the path
array's growth (memory only), the zero-length leg's early out and the leg's normalisation (the
crossings' ratios do not change), the tiny-denominator tests (a vertical leg's division gives no
crossing either way), the empty-way tests (both ways are empty together) and the step's checks
RouteAroundCars makes first (no path, a step already first)."""
